  "name": "CDFD Runtime: Constraint-Driven Flux Dynamics and CDFL Execution Engine",
  "description": "Public command-line runtime for Constraint-Driven Flux Dynamics and CDFL. The active release provides deterministic CLI execution, CDFL lint/format/AST tooling, runtime finite-audit helpers, ontology-backed execution, one reproducible smoke experiment, VS Code CDFL language support, and a research-software paper draft. Outputs are software diagnostics, not empirical proof or deployed decision systems.",
